Z||000014||qwikgta||01-07-2001||05:54 PM||||More info...AIM sells wheel adapters for $39 each.  They convert the 5X100mm to 5x4.5 inch.  It adds 1.5 inch to the offset.  Im not sure what OEM rims have a 5x4.5 inch but I think its Ford and Mopar maybe some Rice burners too.  Not sure if AIM has a website but here is the # 1-800-289-9980.<P>------------------<BR>QWIKGTA<BR>88 T-Top||||reg||10
